# Party banter in the catacombs part of Castle Ravenloft (docs/regions/castle_ravenloft_catacombs.md). Each node
# opens with an `if` gate (the castle's banter plays anywhere in the region, so each says where it belongs).

~ banter_rows
if at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs and not flag.strahd_in_coffin
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: Every one of these rooms has exactly one door. I've counted. I'm going to keep counting.
interject name:ilse_varga: And every one has a tenant. Keep moving, Tealeaf.
endif
-> END

~ banter_wand
if at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs and item:arcane_focus_wand
interject name:silvain_aster: Ash wood, badly balanced, a chip out of the grip. It is a terrible wand. Somebody loved him enough to bury him with it.
interject tag:cheerful: And he loved us enough to leave it lying about. Everybody wins.
endif
-> END

~ banter_names
if at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs and not flag.strahd_destroyed
interject name:hedda_ironvow: All these names. Cooks, grooms, stewards. He buried his servants under his house like a man keeping receipts.
interject tag:blunt: Or a man who doesn't let anybody leave.
endif
-> END

~ banter_sergei
if flag.cat_ireena_at_tomb and guest:ireena and at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs_tombs
interject guest:ireena: I'm fine. I'll tell you when I'm not. Right now I'd like to go and kill someone.
interject tag:loyal: Then we'll go together.
endif
-> END

~ banter_parents
if at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs_tombs and not flag.strahd_in_coffin
interject name:silvain_aster: A king and a queen and their sons, carved on the wall. One face cut away. I wonder whether he did that himself or had someone do it for him.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: Himself. That sort always does it himself.
endif
-> END

~ banter_coffin
if flag.strahd_in_coffin and not flag.strahd_destroyed
interject name:hedda_ironvow: He's down there in the dark with no breath to hold. Morninglord, keep him lying still a little longer.
interject name:ilse_varga: Then we go down. Now. Nobody stops to loot anything.
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: Nobody was going to. Much.
endif
-> END

~ banter_guardians
if flag.cat_guardians_stilled and at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs_tombs
interject tag:veteran: Six statues, and three of them were empty armour that walked. I'll be checking every statue in this castle twice now.
interject class:wizard: The other three were simply statues. I checked. Twice.
endif
-> END
